   163	Exploratory analyses . In addition to assessing the effect of normative outlier on conventional case-control analyses we also conducted some exploratory analysis on the normative w-scores. First, to explore whether the w-scores re /uniFB02 ect a potentially meaningful phenotypic feature we also computed Spearman correlations for each brain region between the most commonly shared phenotypic features in ABIDE: ADOS, SRS, SCQ, AQ, FIQ and Age. Resulting p -values matrices were corrected for multiple comparisons using Benjamini -Hochberg FDR correction and only regions surviving and FDR-corrected p -value of &lt; 0.05 are reported.
